@startuml ATTEMPTS
state "稼働中" as running
running: attempts ; 試行ID ⇸ Attempt
[*] --> running
' promote: local/ATTEMPT.puml 〈滞留〉 → 〈確定〉
running --> running : CONFIRMED?試行ID ; 試行ID ∈ dom attempts ∧ attempts(試行ID) ∈ 〈滞留〉 ; attempts' = attempts ⊕ {試行ID ↦ 〈確定〉} ∧ $手数料' = $手数料
' promote: local/ATTEMPT.puml 〈送信済み〉 → 〈確定〉
running --> running : CONFIRMED?試行ID ; 試行ID ∈ dom attempts ∧ attempts(試行ID) ∈ 〈送信済み〉 ; attempts' = attempts ⊕ {試行ID ↦ 〈確定〉} ∧ $手数料' = $手数料
' promote: local/ATTEMPT.puml 〈送信済み〉 → 〈滞留〉
running --> running : PENDING?試行ID ; 試行ID ∈ dom attempts ∧ attempts(試行ID) ∈ 〈送信済み〉 ; attempts' = attempts ⊕ {試行ID ↦ 〈滞留〉} ∧ $手数料' = $手数料
' promote: local/ATTEMPT.puml 〈未登録〉 → 〈送信済み〉
running --> running : RESEND?試行ID?置換Tx ; 試行ID ∉ dom attempts ∧ $置換Tx の置換元 は〈滞留〉にあり、$置換Tx の手数料 > 置換元 の手数料 ; attempts' = attempts ∪ {試行ID ↦ 〈送信済み〉} ∧ $手数料' = $置換Tx の手数料
' promote: local/ATTEMPT.puml 〈未登録〉 → 〈送信済み〉
running --> running : SEND?試行ID?未署名Tx ; 試行ID ∉ dom attempts ; attempts' = attempts ∪ {試行ID ↦ 〈送信済み〉} ∧ $手数料' = $未署名Tx の手数料
running --> [*] : $attempts のすべてが〈確定〉
note as fair
  assume 手数料を上げた置換を続ければ、いつかいずれかの試行が〈確定〉になる
end note
@enduml
